prd_rules[5]{pk,rule_name,section_pk,severity,summary}:
  1,department_first_act_as_eligibility,2,critical,"User act-as eligibility is department intersection based, not single-user actor ownership."
  2,identity_layer_separation,3,critical,"Auth users authenticate, actors orchestrate, agents provide templates; do not conflate layers."
  3,seed_to_canonical_actor_mapping,3,high,Low seed actor IDs map deterministically to canonical living actor IDs when instantiated.
  4,actor_workspace_contract,4,high,Actor workspace directories and core files must follow canonical structure and attribution rules.
  5,needs_review_requires_review_reason,5,critical,Memory edges with needs_review status require explicit review_reason for routing.

